"`./init_repo.sh` 和 `./quick_start.sh`。见 [ARX Lift "
"2S](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/1-arx_lift2s.md) 和 [高擎 "
"Panthera "
"HT](../2-how_to/6-deployment/9-go_real_hardware/2-panthera_ht.md)。"

