msgstr "常见问题"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:278
#: 641fb5e7a9824552b4990e15e410b4a8
msgid "Submodules Empty"
msgstr "子模块为空"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:280
#: 1dea0d51badd49d0a1b42ff411dbc23c
msgid ""
"Re-run `./init_repo.sh` (menu 1). Do not use `git submodule update --init"
" --recursive` as the primary recovery path."
msgstr ""
"再跑 `./init_repo.sh`（菜单 1）。不要把 `git submodule update --init --recursive` "
"当作主要恢复手段。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:282
#: 4ee8eb82a4c945a2850bd3409d05ac92
msgid "`cannot run ssh` / Access Denied to Submodule"
msgstr "`cannot run ssh` / 子模块拒绝访问"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:284
#: 7b19f307a2bb410da0c82277895ec2f8
msgid ""
"`.gitmodules` URLs are SSH. `insteadOf` HTTPS rewrite alone does not fix "
"`git submodule update`. Current `./init_repo.sh` rewrites `.gitmodules` "
"to HTTPS for the fetch and restores it afterwards — use `--https` / "
"`OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` to force that."
msgstr ""
"`.gitmodules` 的 URL 是 SSH。仅靠 `insteadOf` 改写成 HTTPS 不能修好 `git submodule "
"update`。当前 `./init_repo.sh` 会在拉取时把 `.gitmodules` 改写成 HTTPS，结束后再还原 — 用 "
"`--https` / `OPEN_DEPLOY_GIT_HTTPS=1` 强制走这条路径。"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:286
#: 783752352f57429690301c582aade301
msgid ""
"Some nested modules are private. In `open-deploy-ws`, only public nested "
"modules should be required. If you see access errors:"
msgstr "部分嵌套模块是私有的。在 `open-deploy-ws` 中只需公开嵌套模块。若出现访问错误："

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:288
#: 6db05931b2274e06a035cab32c85bf71
msgid "Check you're on the correct branch (not accidentally on a private branch)"
msgstr "确认当前位于正确的分支（不要误入私有分支）"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:289
#: f8d2582bcbea4ced82a673ca144537aa
msgid "Verify the submodule is listed as public in `submodules_visibility.conf`"
msgstr "确认该子模块在 `submodules_visibility.conf` 中列为公开"

#: ../../source/1-getting_started/3-open_deploy_ws.md:290
#: b60fd0653809472d82576270dcf8a8aa
msgid ""
"If an empty private dir still breaks colcon, re-run `./init_repo.sh` so "
"it writes `COLCON_IGNORE`, or `touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`"
msgstr ""
"若空的私有目录仍导致 colcon 失败，再跑 `./init_repo.sh` 让它写入 `COLCON_IGNORE`，或 "
"`touch <empty-dir>/COLCON_IGNORE`"

